{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"Y\",\n  \"regress\": \"有：S09至S12这些短停留段，Y未标注到时出现的感受词仍然偏密，纵向交替也不如X左右分栏容易一眼扫完。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"Y\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"Y\",\n    \"fine\": \"Y\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y把人物心理转折拆得更清楚，并用【】突出每段关键变化，观众更容易抓住他每一步为什么动摇、为什么又坚持。按音乐时点出现的感受词，也补足了声音、身体反应和复杂情绪的细节，让受气而离开、怀念亲近、害怕孤单、不愿委屈自己回头、最终带着想念继续生活形成完整的心理弧线。X确实更容易快速扫读，但Y在人物理解、前后连贯和感受细腻度上提供了更多实际收获。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "17661863-212f-42f7-aaf9-25969830edaf", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261107T165406851249Z", "elapsed_seconds": 85.406, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T16:55:32.256053+00:00", "model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-5-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "3578d5912d8548b49c156d089cdc0456e7f146637966b903cbfdb27f9c3540c0", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachm